@startuml
title State machine — head revision
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ArrowColor #405670
state "NONE\nchưa có head" as none #E8F0FC
state "DRAFT\nhead chưa approve" as draft #E8F0FC
state "APPROVED\nhead có approval" as approved #DDF3E8
[*] --> none : upload
none --> draft : first successful run / create initial revision
draft --> draft : save or adopt / append + CAS
draft --> approved : approve current head / guards + CAS
approved --> draft : save or adopt / new revision
approved --> approved : export selected approved snapshot
draft --> draft : rerun completes / candidate only
approved --> approved : rerun completes / candidate only
legend bottom
State của head, độc lập job. Historic revisions và approvals không bị ghi đè khi head đổi.
endlegend
@enduml
